{
  "name": "fairclinic-credential-expiry",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Fairclinic Credential Expiry: dental and veterinary licences, DEA registrations, state permits, radiation registrations and malpractice insurance: expired, expiring with no renewal submitted, missing expiry dates, and CE hours short of what the next renewal needs. It never files a renewal or contacts a board, the DEA or an insurer.",
